[/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]clobbered_note_repair_and_guards.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/clobbered_note_repair_and_guards.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-do[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-do/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore the clobbered note and verify the scan[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-repair: restore sase_agent_recovery.md from 8ca09ee75^, let bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task reconcile drop 8 stale mirror links, verify ref scan on athena and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the MacBook, sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Save before the review walk switches notes[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]walk-save-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk-save-guard: in bob-navigation-hotkeys, flush and verify the active [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note before any same-pane note switch, add a clobber tripwire on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]landing, test, build, deploy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault-sync clobber detection and quarantine[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sync-clobber-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync-clobber-guard: detect displaced-plus-foreign-identity rewrites of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked notes before staging, quarantine or warn per the decision, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record in status, alert, document, test.[/#D7D7AF]\n